WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.764 --> 00:00:01.645
You're pretty!

2
00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:03.246
[s@You're pretty!

3
00:00:03.266 --> 00:00:04.186
Who are you?

4
00:00:04.206 --> 00:00:06.648
I'm a monarch butterfly.

5
00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:12.571
Butterflies are insects.

6
00:00:30.688 --> 00:00:31.769
Where do you live?

7
00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.413
We stay near a plant called milkweed.

8
00:00:37.994 --> 00:00:41.156
We live in North America in spring and summer.

9
00:00:44.039 --> 00:00:46.240
In the fall we fly away.

10
00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.684
Oh! Where do you go?

11
00:00:52.405 --> 00:00:55.808
Monarch butterflies usually fly to Mexico.

12
00:00:59.156 --> 00:01:00.637
It's much warmer there.

13
00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:05.299
That's a long trip!

14
00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:10.321
Yes. We fly thousands of kilometers.

15
00:01:12.102 --> 00:01:13.862
I've never made the trip before.

16
00:01:16.263 --> 00:01:17.824
But I'll know where to go.

17
00:01:21.005 --> 00:01:22.646
What do monarchs eat?

18
00:01:24.347 --> 00:01:26.868
Monarch caterpillars eat milkweed.

19
00:01:28.764 --> 00:01:32.746
Monarch butterflies sip nectar from flowers.

20
00:01:37.588 --> 00:01:39.189
Do monarchs lay eggs?

21
00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:43.991
Butterflies lay eggs on milkweed leaves.

22
00:01:45.832 --> 00:01:48.434
Baby caterpillars hatch from the eggs.

23
00:01:50.014 --> 00:01:53.196
The caterpillars begin eating and growing.

24
00:01:55.744 --> 00:01:58.466
How do the caterpillars become butterflies?

25
00:02:01.168 --> 00:02:03.289
The caterpillars stick to leaves.

26
00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:07.552
Their skin turns into a hard case.

27
00:02:08.913 --> 00:02:12.215
Ten days later butterflies fly out!

28
00:02:16.418 --> 00:02:18.940
Well, it's time to fly away.

29
00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:24.644
Have a safe trip, Monarch Butterfly!
